<title>USA: Equitable Co names Stanley Tulin CFO.</title>
<headline>Equitable Co names Stanley Tulin CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equitable Cos Inc said Wednesday that Stanley Tulin was named chief financial officer and executive vice president of the company.</p>
<p>Tulin succeeds Jerry M. de St. Paer, who is joining J.P. Morgan as managing director in its insurance group, Equitable said.</p>
<p>The company said Tulin will continue as chief financial officer of Equitable's principal insurance subsidiary, the Equitable Life Assurance Society of the U.S.</p>
</text>
